a nǐ shàng kè le ma
“Hey, are you in class now?”

632
00:25:37,000 --> 00:25:40,166
你快看看你妹妹的家长群里在说什么
nǐ kuài kàn kàn nǐ mèi mei de jiā zhǎng qún lǐ zài shuō shén me
“Hurry and check what they’re saying in your sister’s parents group”

633
00:25:40,166 --> 00:25:42,600
我不懂你来帮我弄一下
wǒ bù dǒng nǐ lái bāng wǒ nòng yí xià
“I don’t understand, come help me figure it out”

634
00:25:42,600 --> 00:25:44,733
对她总是这样
duì tā zǒng shì zhè yàng
Yeah, she’s always like this

635
00:25:44,733 --> 00:25:46,566
包括昨天
bāo kuò zuó tiān
Even yesterday

636
00:25:46,566 --> 00:25:50,100
昨天她去银行存钱
zuó tiān tā qù yín háng cún qián
Yesterday she went to the bank to deposit money

637
00:25:50,100 --> 00:25:52,966
就是她手里有一点闲钱
jiù shì tā shǒu lǐ yǒu yì diǎn xián qián
She had a bit of extra money on hand

638
00:25:52,966 --> 00:25:54,333
就是没有用的钱
jiù shì méi yǒu yòng de qián
