639
00:25:54,333 --> 00:25:57,600
她想啊存成定期
tā xiǎng a cún chéng dìng qī
She wanted to put it into a fixed deposit

640
00:25:57,600 --> 00:25:58,400
定期的话
dìng qī de huà
As for fixed deposit

641
00:25:58,400 --> 00:26:01,833
就是我们可以把它称作忘了的钱
jiù shì wǒ men kě yǐ bǎ tā chēng zuò wàng le de qián
It’s what we can call “forgotten money”

642
00:26:01,833 --> 00:26:04,200
就是这一年你要放在银行里
jiù shì zhè yì nián nǐ yào fàng zài yín háng lǐ
It stays in the bank for a year

643
00:26:04,200 --> 00:26:05,733
你不能动这个钱
nǐ bù néng dòng zhè gè qián
