“I put three apples in it for you”

699
00:28:24,766 --> 00:28:27,233
我说对我看到了
wǒ shuō duì wǒ kàn dào le
I said, “Yes, I saw them”

700
00:28:27,233 --> 00:28:27,800
为什么
