713
00:28:57,100 --> 00:29:00,300
我明白她是真的很想让我平安
wǒ míng bái tā shì zhēn de hěn xiǎng ràng wǒ píng ān
I understood—she really wanted me to be safe

714
00:29:00,300 --> 00:29:03,366
但是三个苹果这么大
dàn shì sān gè píng guǒ zhè me dà
But those apples were so big

715
00:29:03,366 --> 00:29:05,766
我的天呐
wǒ de tiān na
